From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:27:48 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 25/42] bitproxy: Quick Settings tiles to flip apps between VPN
 and Direct

Three tile slots ('BitProxy app 1..3', tiles must be declared in the
manifest). Pick the app for each slot in Settings > BitProxy > Quick
Settings tiles; the tile shows the app name and VPN/Direct/Blocked,
and a tap flips VPN <-> Direct and re-applies (reloading only if the
VPN runs). An unassigned tile opens BitProxy. Tiles refresh after every
Apply.
